Inspiration
-----------
chdsweep was inspired by two earlier card number scanners.

- ccsrch, by Mike Beekey and Adam Caudill (GPL-2.0).
  https://github.com/adamcaudill/ccsrch
- PANhunt, by Dionach (BSD-3-Clause), and its fork by zbalkan.
  https://github.com/Dionach/PANhunt

Data
----
The BIN table in data/bin-table.csv.gz is derived from bin-list-data by
Venelin Kochev / BinLookup.io, under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). It was changed: trimmed to
the six fields chdsweep uses (tools/bin-trim.py). The first line of the file
gives the upstream commit and the date it was pulled. It is not an official
BIN register. It is compiled into the binary; every report names this source.
https://github.com/venelinkochev/bin-list-data

